  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Due to your appearance being based upon an animal, you also gain their natural weapons. You have natural weapons which you can use to make unarmed strikes. If you hit with them, you deal bludgeoning, piercing, or slashing damage equal to 1d6 + your Strength or Dexterity modifier. You can choose whether to use Strength or Dexterity when attacking with these natural weapons, but must use the same ability score for both the attack and damage roll.</p>",
